		)
		(uuid "b5080770-8307-5fec-a9c0-561734b73002")
	)
	(text "Pinout 1:1 as in the plug of the aftermarket CAN box harness (vehicles/peugeot-508-sw-2015/wiring.md), so the harness fits without re-pinning.\nPositions counted on the plug from the wire side, latch up, 1-8 from the left.\nPositions 5 and 6 are empty in the harness: added for the speaker and spare lines (wires from a second plug).\nHousing pin numbers and which row is the upper one: check on a desoldered socket before the PCB design."
